<title>THAILAND: Alphatech Electronics says CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Alphatech Electronics says CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alphatec Electronics Plc said on Monday that its chief executive officer Charn Uswachoke had resigned from the company.</p>
<p>Chief operating officer Bob Mollersteun had been appointed acting chief executive officer, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Alpahtec shares were suspended earlier on Monday by the Thai stock exchange pending the release of information by the company.</p>
</text>
